1
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,400
Ouyang Xiaotian, come out!

2
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Darn it!
Come out!

3
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Ouyang Xiaotian!

4
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Come out now!

5
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,800
What's so funny?
Show yourself!

6
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,600
Want to know why? You'll know
everything when you breathe your last

7
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Seems to us you've turned into a demon.
Evil and good can never co-exist

8
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,000
We're here today to settle
all our scores

9
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Fine. Meet your doom!

10
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,800
I'll get rid of the poison for you!

11
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,800
Leave me alone!
I don't need you to save me!

12
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:00,000
I'm not going to kill you! Heaven is
merciful. Besides, we're friends!

13
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,600
Do you hear me?
We're friends!

14
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,000
Let me be!

15
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,400
Kill him!

16
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:19,000
No! It's my duty to save lives.
I'll be able to save him! Trust me!

17
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Pin him down

18
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,000
-Hurry! Is it ready?
-Coming...

19
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,800
Cut it up

20
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,000
Quick!

21
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,000
-Careful!
-It's hot!

22
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
He's come to

23
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Lu, pour it out

24
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,600
Feel better?

25
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,000
You'll be all right
after taking this medicine

26
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,600
Why won't you take it?

27
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,600
Why didn't you kill me?

28
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:34,600
I told you - Heaven is merciful.
Besides, we're friends, and I'm a doctor

29
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,600
It's my duty to save you.
Here

30
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:40,600
I won't be grateful to you.
I might even kill you!

31
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:46,000
You can't do that unless you
regain your health and energy, right?

32
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:50,600
Exactly. Given the state you're in,
do you think you can kill us? No way

33
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:54,600
I'll leave the medicine here.
It's up to you to take it

34
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,600
Let's leave him alone

35
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,000
The medicine is right here

36
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,600
Take it

37
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Long live Your Majesty!

38
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,000
-Please rise
-Thank you, Your Majesty

39
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Wei Delu, Wu Fuqi and Mei Shouquan
saved our country from a disaster

40
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:34,000
I hereby appoint them as
Divine Generals!

41
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,800
Thank you, Your Majesty!

42
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,600
We've been plagued by both natural and
man-made disasters in recent years

43
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:46,800
So make sure you do a good job.
Your responsibilities are heavy

44
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:51,000
We will bear Your Majesty's words
in mind

45
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:57,000
The mortals are plagued by disasters
because the Three Lucky Stars...

46
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,000
are not shining on them

47
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,600
Things will be different from now on

48
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,880
What is it?

49
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,000
What wish did Your Highness make?

50
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:29,800
You're now one of the Divine Generals.
It's time you displayed your talent

51
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,000
I hope we'll have a bright future

52
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,000
Let me ask you, Your Highness

53
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:51,000
If I disappear just like a shooting star
one day, what will you do?

54
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:56,000
Why would that happen?
Where will you go?

55
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:01,600
I'll be frank with you.
I'm not a mortal

56
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:08,000
I'm actually the Prosperity Star who's
come down to the mortal world to suffer

57
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:13,000
One of these days,
I'll have to return to Heaven

58
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:18,600
I don't believe you. How could you
deceive me with such a story?

59
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:27,800
Why would I deceive you,
Your Highness?

60
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,000
I just don't want to hurt you

61
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,800
I will leave sooner or later

62
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,000
I don't care what reason you have

63
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Just tell me - will you marry me?

64
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,000
What do you think of this fabric?

65
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,000
Have a look.
Why won't you say anything?

66
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:58,600
I've kept it for many years.
You can use it as a quilt cover

67
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,600
Whatever for?

68
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:05,000
Don't you know newly-weds
must have a new quilt?

69
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:09,000
-Who's getting married?
-You and Wu Fuqi

70
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,000
Didn't you use to dislike him?

71
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:19,000
Well, he used to be
a good-for-nothing and a gambler

72
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,000
But now, he's a general.
Things are different

73
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,000
What has that got to do with me?

74
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:29,000
He already said he didn't want me

75
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Who said anything to that effect?

76
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:35,000
General!
Speak of the devil!

77
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:39,600
-These are for you
-You shouldn't have gone to the expense

78
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,000
Shuangxi...

79
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:54,000
She's still angry with you
for posing as an immortal

80
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Go and appease her.
You have my support

81
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Have a discussion to
fix a date for your wedding

82
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
I'll get on with my chores

83
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:17,000
Sis asked us to fix a date
for our wedding...

84
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:19,000
I'm not going to marry you

85
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,800
Shuangxi...

86
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,600
Don't be angry, Shuangxi

87
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,000
I can explain everything

88
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:44,000
Don't be so fierce.
Simmer down

89
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:51,000
Remember the fortune bag you gave me?

90
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,000
Look!

91
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:58,000
You're having me on again.
The bag wasn't so big

92
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,600
It is this big!

93
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:06,600
My biggest fortune is to
make you my wife

94
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,000
Who's going to marry you?

95
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,000
-Come on, Shuangxi...
-Let go!

96
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,800
Marry me!

97
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Marry me!
I can't do without you!

98
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:22,000
You mean it?

99
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,600
Why would I lie to you?
I must make you my wife

100
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,000
How about the eighth day
of the eighth month?

101
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,000
What about it?

102
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,000
You just said you'd marry me!

103
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,800
-The Eighth day of the eighth month?
-Well?

104
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:41,600
-I'm afraid...
-Of what?

105
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:47,000
Shou said if we can't return to
the Celestial Court before we turn 30,

106
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:50,000
disaster will befall us...

107
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,600
You still think
you're the Fortune Star?

108
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:57,000
How could you lie to me
time and again! You're too much!

109
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Shuangxi!

110
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:17,800
Deity of Marriage!
What are you doing?

111
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:22,600
Zhang!
What brings you over today?

112
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,600
Long time no see.
Let's have a drink

113
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
You're treating me to a drink?

114
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:31,000
See, I've brought my gourd

115
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,600
Please don't get me into trouble

116
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,600
When I get drunk,
I tend to tie the wrong knots

117
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:43,000
I've received many complaints.
I mustn't make any more mistakes

118
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:48,600
So you're aware of it. Why did you still
propose marriage as Ma-gu's father then?

119
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,600
Weren't you bold!

120
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,000
Don't spread news around

121
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,600
What should be done?

122
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:59,000
They've fallen in love. Even I can't
do anything, let alone you

123
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,600
Now I'm different from you

124
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:05,000
It's not too late to make amends

125
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:09,000
Quickly cut off the string that ties
Wei Delu to Princess Ruining,

126
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:13,000
and the string that ties
Wu Fuqi to Yu Shuangxi,

127
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:16,000
so they won't be in agony
like Mei Shouquan and Ma-gu

128
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:20,800
Aren't you cruel to want to
break up three loving couples

129
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:25,000
Why in the world did the Jade Emperor
put you in charge of marriages?

130
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:29,000
Every mortal who falls in love
is blinded by it

131
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:35,000
The Trio are supposed to attain immor-
tality. How could they fall in love?

132
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,000
Where are the strings
that tie them together?

133
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:40,000
-Don't make a mess of my strings...
-Find theirs, quick!

134
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:45,600
-Don't rush me. I'll do it myself...
-Be quick!

135
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
I kind of sympathize with them

136
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:58,000
Mei Shouquan and Ma-gu were planning
to do something for the people

137
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:03,600
But now they've been torn apart.
One is in Heaven, and the other, on Earth

138
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
I feel so bad

139
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:11,000
But then if the Trio
can't return to Heaven,

140
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:14,800
the mortals will suffer even more

141
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Once they return to Heaven, they'll
have to part with their loved ones

142
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:22,600
What a knotty problem!

143
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:28,800
When I think of that,
I feel I'm not fit to be an immortal

144
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:34,000
I must ask the Jade Emperor for early
retirement one day and go back home

145
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,600
How come I just can't find them...?

146
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,000
How can it be?

147
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,000
Maybe it's Heaven's will

148
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,400
Indeed!
Find the strings, quick!

149
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,000
Bad news!

150
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Ouyang Xiaotian has been beaten
by the Trio!

151
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:55,600
What!
What a good-for-nothing he is!

152
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:59,000
I bet he didn't do his best!

153
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,600
Are you disappointed, Master?

154
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:07,000
If only he'd won!
I'd have been able to eat the Trio up

155
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:11,000
I'd have existed as long as Heaven
and be on a par with the Jade Emperor

156
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,800
There's such an advantage
for eating the Trio?

157
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:18,000
Bring him here.
I'll feed him to the Spider!

158
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,600
What!

159
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,000
I feel so sorry for him

160
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:37,000
He's been stripped of all his skills

161
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:42,800
-Go and capture him
-No. You go. He's too pitiful

162
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:45,800
If neither of us will go,
who's going to capture him?

163
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,600
We'll do it together

164
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,600
Xiaotian!

165
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:42,800
Where are you going?
There's nowhere you can go now

166
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:47,600
You're right.
I brought this upon myself

167
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,600
I don't need anybody's help

168
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:56,800
Don't be so stubborn. Turn back.
It's the only way out for you

169
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:58,800
I don't need any sympathy!

170
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,600
It's no longer possible for us

171
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,000
I wish you and Wei Delu all the best

172
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:10,000
I'm showing concern for a friend!

173
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:17,000
Thanks.
I may not know where I should go,

174
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,000
but I know where I should head

175
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:23,600
I don't need your concern!

176
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:42,600
-I feel so sorry for him...
-Seize him before it's too late!

177
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,000
I can't bring myself to do it!

178
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,600
It's better for him than for us
to be fed to the Spider

179
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:52,000
We won't be in Master's
good books forever

180
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:55,000
I'm afraid we might end up like him

181
00:18:55,000 --> 00:19:00,000
I know. Once we outlive our usefulness,
Master will treat us the same way

182
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:04,000
What are we going to do...?

183
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:07,800
Got it!

184
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,600
Where are you, Ruyi?

185
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:30,600
Where on earth are you?
Can you hear me calling you?

186
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,000
Ruyi!

187
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:38,600
I miss you, Ruyi.
I really miss you

188
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:44,600
Ruyi, where are you?

189
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Ruyi...

190
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:57,000
How I wish I'd turn into an immortal
right away. I'd be able to see you then

191
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:05,000
Ruyi, I may live in this world,

192
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:08,000
but I don't feel blessed at all

193
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:11,600
In fact, I feel
Heaven is torturing me

194
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:14,600
Can you hear me?

195
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:19,800
Ruyi, can you hear me?

196
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:25,000
Ruyi, can you hear me?

197
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:35,000
To think Longevity has become
an affectionate man in the mortal world

198
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:40,000
Exactly. I wonder what caused
the change in him

199
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:46,800
I've finally seen the power of love

200
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:51,600
All along, I thought
only money could make one yield

201
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,000
But look at him

202
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:57,000
Why don't we help him?

203
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,000
Help him?

204
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:04,000
Ruyi, can you hear me?
Please answer me!

205
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Where are you?

206
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:13,000
Ruyi!

207
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Answer me!

208
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:21,000
You can't just give me
the cold shoulder!

209
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,000
Ruyi!

210
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Ruyi, please answer me.
Don't give me the cold shoulder

211
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,000
I really miss you...

212
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:48,000
Ruyi...

213
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,000
Longie!

214
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Who is it?

215
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:53,800
-Longie!
-Who is it?

216
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:55,800
I'm behind you

217
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:04,000
Your face is so white, and yours,
so red! Are you lobsters or humans?

218
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:07,000
We're immortals

219
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,000
Immortals?

220
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:13,000
No wonder you don't recognize us. A day
in Heaven is a few hundred years on earth

221
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:16,000
I'm God of Wealth,
and he, God of Kitchen

222
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:20,000
All three of us
serve the Jade Emperor

223
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:23,800
Really? You're God of Kitchen,
and you, God of Wealth?

224
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:26,000
Let me offer you a drink then

225
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:30,000
Don't pour the wine away...

226
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:33,000
-Is it enough?
-Yes...

227
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:38,000
-Do you want to see Ma-gu?
-I miss her so much

228
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:40,000
Shall we take you to her?

229
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:43,000
Do you mean what you said?

230
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:47,000
It's all because of us
she's being locked up

231
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:49,000
She's being locked up?

232
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:52,600
The Deity of Plague made use of us.
Do give us a chance to make amends!

233
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:56,800
Sure.
Take me to her at once!

234
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,800
-Any more wine?
-There's a little left

235
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:00,800
I'll keep it for you

236
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,000
She's inside

237
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:35,800
-Ruyi!
-Shou!

238
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,000
-Shou!
-Ruyi!

239
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:44,000
What happened?
Why can't I get in?

240
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,000
This is the most we can do

241
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:48,000
We'll keep watch for you outside

242
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:55,880
Ruyi...

243
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:02,600
-How are you, Shou?
-I'm fine

244
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:06,000
You've lost weight

245
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:15,000
Why did you come here? Go.
I don't want to get you into trouble

246
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:19,800
I'm not afraid
so long as I can see you

247
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:23,000
I have so many things to say to you

248
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:26,000
I missed you so much

249
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:30,000
Things in the mortal world
are getting better

250
00:24:31,800 --> 00:24:33,800
But my heart sinks day by day

251
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:36,000
Don't lose heart

252
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:40,000
When good fortune is boundless as
the seas, and longevity is comparable...

253
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:43,000
to the mountains,
you'll be able to return to Heaven

254
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:51,000
I really don't know
what kind of phenomenon that is

255
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:54,000
How will I make it happen?

256
00:24:55,000 --> 00:25:01,000
I really can't think
what kind of phenomenon it is like

257
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:07,000
I really don't know...

258
00:25:09,800 --> 00:25:14,400
Never mind about that.
I'll get you out first

259
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:18,600
No, Shou!

260
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,000
Shou!

261
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,000
Leave!
Don't bother about me!

262
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,000
No, Shou!
Just go!

263
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:44,000
Shou!

264
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,000
Shou!

265
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:11,000
How foolish of you.
I don't want you to get hurt

266
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:18,000
I'm willing to pay any price
to get you out

267
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:23,000
Let's get out of here

268
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:30,000
"The top scholar, Wei Delu,
is a rare talent"

269
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:33,000
"I hereby make him Prince Consort"

270
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:37,600
May you and Princess Ruining
be a loving couple and...

271
00:26:37,600 --> 00:26:40,600
live in bliss all your lives

272
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:45,000
Congratulations to Her Highness
and Prince Consort!

273
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:49,000
Congratulations

274
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:57,000
Wait, Father! Pardon me for being rude.
I object to the arrangement

275
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:07,000
What's going on?
You're confusing me!

276
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:27,000
Fuqi Armed Escort Agency
is now officially open!

277
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:36,600
Please help yourselves to the food.
Forgive me if I've been a poor host

278
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:45,600
Where's my mother?

279
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:49,600
We asked her to come for the
opening ceremony but she refused

280
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:51,600
She even stayed in her room and cried

281
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:57,000
Peng Datou?
Come over

282
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:01,880
Go

283
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:08,000
Why are you drinking here?

284
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:11,600
I have nothing more to do with
your mother. Don't beat me!

285
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:16,000
I didn't come to beat you
but to talk reason with you

286
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:18,000
Talk reason?

287
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:23,600
Here you are drinking alone
while my mother is crying at home

288
00:28:23,600 --> 00:28:25,600
What's the point?

289
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:30,000
She said she asks for nothing now
so long as you're happy

290
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:33,000
If I stick with her,
will you be pleased?

291
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:39,000
Relax, I know my mother inside out.
She needs you very much actually

292
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
And I intend to make you the chief
armed escort agent of my agency

293
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:51,000
You approve of us now?

294
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:53,800
Of course

295
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:59,000
Don't go away

296
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:01,000
Get down!

297
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:05,000
From now on, you mustn't fight anymore

298
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:10,600
Are you sick?
You used to disapprove of Datou

299
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:15,000
That was because
you never went through the rite

300
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:19,000
-Are you willing to marry my mother?
-Yes, yes!

301
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:22,600
-But I don't have any bride price
-I do

302
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:26,000
-Are you willing to marry him?
-Sure, sure!

303
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:29,800
-But I don't have any dowry
-I do

304
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:33,000
Your relationship is proper now

305
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,600
Let's go home!

306
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:40,000
What about you and Shuangxi?

307
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:46,000
Don't worry. Given my eloquence,
she'll be appeased in no time

308
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:48,000
Let's go home!

309
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:56,800
You must be busy with state affairs.
What brings you here today?

310
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:05,000
Frankly, I came to seek
your advice on something

311
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:11,800
Please speak your mind.
I'm willing to share your worry

312
00:30:13,800 --> 00:30:19,800
Tell me, Reverend.
Is life nothing but misery?

313
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:22,000
What makes you say that?

314
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:25,000
When I failed my exams,
I was miserable

315
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:28,000
Now that I'm the top scholar,
I'm still miserable

316
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:32,600
When I couldn't be with Her Highness,
I was miserable

317
00:30:32,600 --> 00:30:35,000
Now that I can, I'm still miserable

318
00:30:35,800 --> 00:30:41,000
Isn't life full of misery?

319
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:47,600
Please tell me how I can stay away
from misery and be happy

320
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:54,000
In my opinion, before you held
any position, your life was carefree

321
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:58,000
Now that you're an official,
you enjoy speaking up for the people

322
00:30:58,000 --> 00:31:03,600
Before Her Highness fancied you,
you wrote poems to entertain yourself

323
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:08,000
After you marry her,
you'll live in bliss

324
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:11,600
Is life full of misery at all?

325
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:15,000
As for the hardships you suffer,

326
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:20,000
they're meant to temper you
and make you strong

327
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:24,000
You're to bring prosperity to people

328
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:28,000
Bring prosperity to people?

329
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:33,000
When you were an unsuccessful candidate,
you were able to enjoy life

330
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:37,600
Yet now that you're a high-ranking
official, you're fretting

331
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:42,000
That shows it's nothing to be
happy about when you gain something,

332
00:31:42,000 --> 00:31:46,000
and it's nothing to fret about
whne you lose something either

333
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:48,000
You mean...?

334
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:51,000
Leave it all to fate

335
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:56,000
Take it when it comes your way,
and let go when it's gone

336
00:31:57,000 --> 00:32:02,600
You'll be free from all worries then

337
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:05,600
Amitabha

338
00:32:05,600 --> 00:32:07,600
Please excuse me

339
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:22,600
Isn't this the Palace?
Why did we come here?

340
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:28,000
Lord Erlang will never dream
we'd have the guts to hide here

341
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:32,000
You're right.
Let's stay here for the time being

342
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:36,000
What's the matter?

343
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:40,000
This place may be safe, but we can
only be together for the time being

344
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:45,600
Heaven is so cruel. Why is it that
good things never last?

345
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:48,000
Let's not dwell on it anymore

346
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:52,800
There are many challenges ahead of us.
Let's just be happy while we can

347
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:58,600
It'll be my 30th birthday
in a few days. If anything...

348
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:04,000
Let's just enjoy ourselves
these few days

349
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:11,000
All right. Who knows, things might
turn out for the better later

350
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:52,600
Your Highness, it's true that
I'm an immortal

351
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:57,600
It's not an excuse I made up
to leave you

352
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:01,000
Agree to the marriage proposal then

353
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:09,600
Listen to me. I feel a couple shouldn't
keep anything from each other

354
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:14,800
Fine, you're an immortal. Can't you
go against the arrangement for my sake?

355
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:27,000
Yes, I can. Being an immortal
is no big deal actually

356
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:35,000
I'm a human at the moment.
I just want to be an ordinary man -

357
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:38,000
one who's happy,

358
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:44,000
and is able to be with his beloved

359
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:47,000
This is what I mean by being ordinary

360
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:04,600
Your Highness, we've...

361
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:10,800
We've wasted too much time

362
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:14,000
I'll do anything for you

363
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:23,000
For your sake, I'll even
go to the extent of...

364
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:30,000
giving up my chance to be an immortal

365
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:38,600
Are you really willing to give it up
for my sake?

366
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:16,800
Shou, look!

367
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:22,600
It's food from the imperial kitchen.
We get to eat what the Emperor eats

368
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:25,000
You must be hungry.
Have some

369
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:29,000
It's delicious!

370
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:34,000
Trust you to be such a glutton!
Is it enough? I'll go and get some more

371
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:38,000
No. I'm content
just to have you by my side

372
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:42,600
I must make the most
of the time we have together

373
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:45,600
I'm a happy man

374
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:21,600
Heaven and Earth combine as one!
I'm the supreme ruler!

375
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:32,800
The nine planets have formed an arc!
Heaven is on my side!

376
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:41,000
Three Stars, you subdued my Nian.
Have a taste of my new pet!

377
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:46,000
So many fireflies.
How beautiful!

378
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:52,600
It's glittering everywhere. Don't you
feel as if we were in the Milky Way?

379
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:56,000
I don't know
what the Milky Way is like

380
00:37:56,000 --> 00:38:01,000
Anyway, I don't mind where I am
so long as I'm with you

381
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:09,000
It's a man's good fortune
to be able to marry a woman like you

382
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:12,600
You're teasing me again

383
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:18,000
I'm not. You make me feel
I'm the luckiest man in the world

384
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:21,000
I'm really grateful to you

385
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:26,600
These fireflies may be beautiful,
but their lives are short

386
00:38:26,600 --> 00:38:31,000
I hope our happiness won't be
as shortlived

387
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:36,600
I've made up my mind, Shuangxi.
I don't want to be an immortal

388
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:38,600
I must stay in the mortal world

389
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:41,600
Isn't that too big a sacrifice?

390
00:38:41,600 --> 00:38:46,600
It's not a sacrifice at all.
Zhang Guolao said I'm the Fortune Star

391
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:53,000
But I'm the luckiest man in the world
now. What do I want to go to Heaven for?

392
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:03,000
Why have the fireflies disappeared?
What's going on?

393
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:05,000
Where have all of them gone?

394
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:34,600
Why did the sky turn so red?

395
00:39:34,800 --> 00:39:36,800
-It's the Deity of Plague
-Deity of Plague?

396
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:41,000
He's let the Spider Spirit out.
A disaster has befallen earth

397
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:44,000
The Spider Spirit has sucked up
all the water

398
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:47,000
Is there any way to subdue to it?

399
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:53,000
Shou, though I'm happy with you,

400
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:57,800
we mustn't hide here like cowards
and fend only for ourselves anymore

401
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
The people are in trouble.
We mustn't just think of ourselves

402
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:11,000
Even as humans,
our conscience will be bugging at us

403
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:14,000
Right.
Let's go

404
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:10,000
Mother!
Where are you? Mother!

405
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:14,800
A spider!
Help!

406
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:35,000
Where's Jiujin?

407
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:38,000
Mother!

408
00:41:49,800 --> 00:41:51,800
Mother!

409
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:08,000
Shou, it's Lord Erlang!

410
00:42:22,800 --> 00:42:23,800
Stop there!

411
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:27,000
Ma Ruyi!

412
00:42:29,000 --> 00:42:31,000
There's no way you can escape!

413
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:38,000
How dare you come to the mortal world!
Go back with me!

414
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:42,000
Do you know the Deity of Plague has
let the Spider Spirit out to wreak havoc?

415
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:46,000
Instead of subduing it, you came
after Ma-gu. You're too much!

416
00:42:46,600 --> 00:42:49,600
Cut that out!
Ma-gu, leave with me now!

417
00:42:49,600 --> 00:42:51,000
Listen to me, Erlang!

418
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:56,000
Ma-gu came down to the mortal world
because I asked her to

419
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:59,000
She isn't to blame.
Please let her off!

420
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:03,000
Please, I beg you!

421
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:07,000
Please have mercy on us

422
00:43:08,000 --> 00:43:13,000
I give you my word that once
Fu, Lu, Ma-gu and I have subdued...

423
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:18,000
the Spider Spirit and Deity of Plague,
we'll go to Heaven to receive punishment

424
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:20,000
Please believe us just this once!

425
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:24,600
You have to go through three disasters
and six tribulations to become immortals

426
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:30,800
So it shouldn't be Ma-gu's concern
to subdue the Spider Spirit at all

427
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:34,000
Don't be so stubborn!

428
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:38,000
No more nonsense! You're not fit
to talk terms with me yet!

429
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:40,000
Wait till you've become an immortal!

430
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Ma-gu, go!

431
00:43:49,000 --> 00:43:53,000
I'll leave with you! He's a mortal
after all. Don't be difficult with him

432
00:43:53,000 --> 00:43:55,000
Run, Ruyi!

433
00:43:55,000 --> 00:43:57,000
You must accept this, Shou

434
00:43:57,000 --> 00:43:59,000
I said run!
Don't bother about me!

435
00:43:59,000 --> 00:44:03,000
Find Fu and Lu and see how you can
subdue the Spider Spirit

436
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:08,000
I'm sure once you're back in place,
there will be peace again

437
00:44:09,000 --> 00:44:13,000
Remember - you're sacrificing
yourselves for the mortals, not for me

438
00:44:13,600 --> 00:44:14,600
No!

439
00:44:14,600 --> 00:44:15,600
Go!

440
00:44:17,000 --> 00:44:19,800
Ruyi!

441
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:24,000
Ruyi...!

442
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:31,000
Mother!

443
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:35,000
Mother...!

444
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:38,000
Subtitled by S Lin


